  <item>
    <title>S2E1|“莫名其妙的自信”从何而来？百年演讲俱乐部如何助力职场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674ec8da17cd5416ad1a565b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674ec8da17cd5416ad1a565b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Dec 2024 09:24:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这一期播客中，嘉宾杨雪和Ivan分享了百年峰会的见闻以及他们加入Toastmasters俱乐部的成长之旅，在演讲俱乐部如何提高沟通能力和领导力，他们都拥有了“莫名其妙的自信”，从而助力了职场发展。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>杨雪（D88 Program Quality Director，DTM 杰出Toastmasters会员，北京胡同双语演讲俱乐部，All About Career Toastmasters俱乐部）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ivan（Region Advisor，DTM 杰出Toastmasters会员，The Blooming Toastmasters 俱乐部）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mavis（D88 播客项目主理人，EF Phoenixes Toastmasters俱乐部）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">00:02:04</a>:国际峰会的震撼体验：现场比现场演唱会更激动人心！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">00:06:58</a>:头马：从程序员到自信应对职场挑战的职业转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">00:10:29</a>:成长之路：Toastmasters百年培养卓越沟通能力的秘诀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">00:13:58</a>:培养自信的沟通风格：打破传统，展现真实的自我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">00:20:57</a>:真实的反馈，高效的沟通：演讲俱乐部的不一样之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1466">00:24:26</a>:通过演讲展现领导力：Toastmasters教育体系的行动学习法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">00:27:57</a>:领导力之路：通过小细节打造卓越领导者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2307">00:38:27</a>:领导力与沟通力：在Toastmasters中成长与收获的故事</span></p>]]></description>
