    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b07f237349f7a557d67bec</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 07:28:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这一期播客中，嘉宾Stephen和猫猫分享了他们在加入和参观Toastmasters俱乐部时的第一印象，分享了很多初次参加俱乐部活动时受到热情接待的细节，以及从第一印象中得到的收获如何迁移到工作和生活中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>细微处见真章，温水中有温情，没想到职场中的换位思考、社交链接、人文关怀都蕴含在这不起眼的第一印象之中，想知道具体的故事吗？快来收听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>紫嫣（北京梦想Toastmasters俱乐部，读书会创始人，声音主播）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stephen Hu（DTM 杰出Toastmasters会员）</span></p><span></span><p><span>猫猫（ 北京驿站Toastmasters俱乐部，北京诗词Toastmasters俱乐部）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a>:第一印象的重要性：打造令人印象深刻的俱乐部会议体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">00:04:03</a>:俱乐部访客体验三件套：场地指引、来宾册与姓名贴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="933">00:15:33</a>:MOT关键时刻：细节决定成败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">00:19:36</a>:解决访客疑问：俱乐部指引与来宾册的妙用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">00:27:25</a>:温度与专业度：提升宾客参会体验的关键要素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1881">00:31:21</a>:精准满足需求，赢得访客心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">00:35:16</a>:接待访客时的重要瞬间：即兴演讲、反馈和交流的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">00:39:08</a>:从第一印象开始，如何塑造良好的形象？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2586">00:43:06</a>:能力可迁移：如何在工作中给上级留下良好的第一印象？</span></p><span></span><h3><br></h3><span></span><h3><span>【制作团队】</span></h3><span></span><h3><span>策划统筹｜Mavis，Leon Yang，Nancy Wang</span></h3><span></span><h3><span>音频剪辑｜徐晓港, Mavis</span></h3><span></span><h3><span>文字排版｜大哲</span></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?src=11&amp;timestamp=1722909490&amp;ver=5427&amp;signature=gdRRXkFnVVY4ECLM8v3J-PUCODKjynzwhm9vXseGqBZoX3biygINbjaab*BFjrqHHm-PVjGVoysk9MfnCyHxgBGDaFCPF2vOMONXxntDAZCoahA46ROWEtsvNAjZiEvV&amp;new=1" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?src=11&amp;timestamp=1722909490&amp;ver=5427&amp;signature=gdRRXkFnVVY4ECLM8v3J-PUCODKjynzwhm9vXseGqBZoX3biygINbjaab*BFjrqHHm-PVjGVoysk9MfnCyHxgBGDaFCPF2vOMONXxntDAZCoahA46ROWEtsvNAjZiEvV&amp;new=1"><span>【文字版】MOT 系列访谈之一：第一印象</span></a></h3>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnHid-DBG35jW3WWrX2fwSihPJOk.m4a" length="68055415" type="audio/mp4"/>
