    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从破冰演讲到DTM，探索Toastmasters的成长秘籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>掌握领导力与沟通能力，是成长不可或缺的两个要素。DTM Simon的经验告诉我们，千里之行，始于足下，领导力之旅开始于破冰演讲，将所学应用到实践中去，是持续保持热情、挖掘Toastmasters价值的关键。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>DTM:</span></strong><span> Distinguished Toastmaster 杰出Toastmasters会员，Toastmasters会员教育成就最高荣誉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>AI配图：Toastmasters 新人成长之旅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqawToyTSvKgnNfI3ScJ71RsXGqv.png"></figure>]]></description>
