    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你曾经体会过创业或团队初创时的挑战吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>下集，让我们一起听听，Nancy在Toastmasters领导力修炼之旅中，将恐惧转化为动力，实现事业成长与团队发展双赢的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mavis （Toastmasters会员，演讲、英语爱好者）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nancy &nbsp;（Toastmasters墨尔本第一双语俱乐部发起人&amp;创会主席，财富沙盘教练，人生体验师）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">00:02:06</a>:建立俱乐部过程中的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">00:04:06</a>:如何建立一个持续长久的俱乐部体系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">00:17:57</a>:帮助他人成长：如何根据会员的需求提供个性化的解决方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">00:21:35</a>:创始会员的选择，关键节点和挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">00:32:21</a>:从自我设限到成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2373">00:39:33</a>:从个人生活到事业：通过创办俱乐部实现人生愿景</span></p>]]></description>
