  <item>
    <title>S1E1|创造理想的生活方式--Nancy的创会故事（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f807b86764957079063e78</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f807b86764957079063e78</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Mar 2024 09:22:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>创办一家Toastmasters演讲俱乐部是怎样一种人生体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在澳洲生活的Nancy通过发起一家双语俱乐部，完成了一次人生蜕变，也创造了自己理想中的生活方式，让我们来听听她的创会故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mavis （Toastmasters十级爱好者）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nancy &nbsp;（Toastmasters墨尔本第一双语俱乐部发起人&amp;创会主席，财富沙盘教练，人生体验师）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">00:02:05</a>:探索头马的传承与多元文化：澳洲第一家双语Toastmasters俱乐部创会故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">00:04:08</a>:追寻梦想：从孕育想法到团队合作的旅程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">00:07:41</a>:挑战与成长：建立头马俱乐部的艰辛与收获</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">00:11:32</a>:共同探索自我提升的奥秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">00:15:26</a>:一个人的转变与成长之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">00:19:17</a>:在创会过程中的关键支持角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">00:23:10</a>:感动分享：一个人的存在对于创会的重要性和收获的感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1623">00:27:03</a>:自我超越之旅：经历挫折、坚持到底，最终获得成功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">00:30:53</a>:探索自我——这200多天的收获与思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2083">00:34:43</a>:心路历程：探索Toastmasters的传承之道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">00:38:38</a>:挑战自我，追寻梦想：成为一个优秀的leader之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2546">00:42:26</a>:沟通力与领导力：迈向成长的永无止境之旅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li-Hr5X_sIdUtp5_oP0AGznvqV6W.m4a" length="68309724" type="audio/mp4"/>
